+# Setup Passport: koajs/koa
+
+✅ **VERIFIED**: FirstRun followed this project's setup docs on a clean `node:18` machine, repaired what broke, then replayed the corrected guide from zero.
+
+| | |
+|---|---|
+| Commit | `824c1cf8de` |
+| Verified | 2026-09-25 21:24 UTC |
+| Runtime | Node.js 18 (`node:18`) |
+| Clone to running, from zero | **8s** |
+| Steps followed | 1 from the docs, 1 added by FirstRun |
+| Breaks found / fixed | 2 / 2 |
+| Needs a human | 0 |
+| Done when | `npm test` passes |
+
+**Before FirstRun**, a newcomer following the docs got stuck at `npm test` (Readme.md:168).
+
+## Verified setup
+
+```bash
+npm install
+npm test
+```
+
+## Evidence
+
+Every change to the docs is backed by a command that failed before the fix and passed after it.
+
+### E1: Wrong runtime version <a id="e1"></a>
+
+- **Docs said:** `npm test` (Readme.md:168)
+- **Cause:** The README's Node.js 7 is too old: the project needs Node.js 18 (the error ("node: bad option: --test"): `--test` requires Node.js 18+).
+- **Diagnosed by:** FirstRun rule `node-test-flag`, confidence 95%
+- **Doc change:** Node.js 18 or newer (`--test` runner requires Node.js 18+)
+- **Result:** fixed and verified
+
+<details><summary>Before (failing output)</summary>
+
+```
+npm info it worked if it ends with ok
+npm info using npm@4.2.0
+npm info using node@v7.10.1
+npm info lifecycle koa@3.2.1~pretest: koa@3.2.1
+npm info lifecycle koa@3.2.1~test: koa@3.2.1
+
+> koa@3.2.1 test /workspace
+> node --test
+
+node: bad option: --test
+npm info lifecycle koa@3.2.1~test: Failed to exec test script
+npm ERR! Test failed.  See above for more details.
+npm WARN Local package.json exists, but node_modules missing, did you mean to install?
+```
+</details>
+
+<details><summary>Fix applied</summary>
+
+```
+rebased onto node:18
+```
+</details>
+
+<details><summary>After (passing output)</summary>
+
+```
+  ...
+1..91
+# tests 461
+# suites 288
+# pass 461
+# fail 0
+# cancelled 0
+# skipped 0
+# todo 0
+# duration_ms 1422.800374
+```
+</details>
+
+### E2: Missing or out-of-order step <a id="e2"></a>
+
+- **Docs said:** `npm test` (Readme.md:168)
+- **Cause:** Dependencies were never installed before "npm test"; the docs skip `npm install`.
+- **Diagnosed by:** FirstRun rule `deps-not-installed`, confidence 90%
+- **Doc change:** npm install
+- **Result:** fixed and verified
+
+<details><summary>Before (failing output)</summary>
+
+```
+  failureType: 'testCodeFailure'
+  exitCode: 1
+  error: 'test failed'
